{"id":"E-001","analysis":"terminal_nonlinear_robustness","relation":"supports","targets":["H-001"],"hypothesis_id":"H-001","metric":"APEAL_Index","n":8380,"coverage":"FULL","weight":"APEAL_WT","question":"里程非线性是否在控制后仍存在？","finding":"NEV_12 业务分箱相对线性模型的增量检验 nested F=10.51(p<0.001)，加权均值为 <1k 783.83、1k-5k 801.72、5k-10k 789.32、10k-20k 776.41、20k-50k 767.25、50k+ 794.69。1k-5k 达峰，之后总体回落，50k+ 为小样本反弹。","controls":["SUPER_SEGMENT_DP","CN_YNV_07","PREMMAKE_DP","AGE_BUCKETS","CN_INCOME","CN_EDUCATION","SEGMENT_DP"],"caveat":"横截面里程梯度；50k+ n=13，不作为主证据。","parents":[]}
{"id":"E-002","analysis":"terminal_module_item_drilldown","relation":"supports","targets":["H-002"],"hypothesis_id":"H-002","metric":"AFUEL_Index / module indexes / items","n":8380,"coverage":"FULL","weight":"APEAL_WT","question":"非线性是否形成跨模块、可执行的 item 机制？","finding":"加入 FULL+SEGMENT_DP 后，AFUEL_Index 相对 <1k 的系数为 1k-5k -13.53(p=0.059)、5k-10k -25.74(p=0.001)、10k-20k -54.70(p<0.001)、20k-50k -78.51(p<0.001)、50k+ -88.48(p<0.001)。AFUEL_R_01 加权均值从 <1k 8.25、1k-5k 8.09、5k-10k 7.97、10k-20k 7.71、20k-50k 7.44、50k+ 7.32，方向与 AFUEL 模块一致；但 APEAL 总体的 10k-20k/20k-50k 系数不显著，其他模块方向不完全一致。","controls":["SUPER_SEGMENT_DP","CN_YNV_07","PREMMAKE_DP","SEGMENT_DP","AGE_BUCKETS","CN_INCOME","CN_EDUCATION"],"caveat":"模块与 item 结果支持补能/续航体验回落，但不支持所有体验面共同衰减。","parents":["E-001"]}
{"id":"E-003","analysis":"terminal_stop_check","relation":"rules_out","targets":["H-003"],"hypothesis_id":"H-003","metric":"scope boundary","n":8380,"coverage":"FULL","weight":"APEAL_WT","question":"是否可以把长里程回落命名为产品质量衰减？","finding":"不能。长里程回落可能来自车龄、车型 cohort、车主结构或幸存者 mix；当前横截面数据没有纵向同车追踪，也没有足够证据证明总体产品质量衰减。T10 以 INCONCLUSIVE 终止，不升级 READY。","controls":["FULL","SEGMENT_DP"],"caveat":"需纵向面板、车龄/上市 cohort 或售后事件数据才能重启该问题。","parents":["E-001","E-002"]}
